[{"id":2980263612,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6xoza8","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Makes sense to me to simplify these functions; they're definitely more complex than they need to be.\r\nHowever, `initializer_list` has a hidden cost for non-trivial types. You can read about this problem here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12247\r\n\r\nWe've chosen to ignore this problem in most cases, since it's unlikely to lead to problems for most allocations.\r\nHowever, as commonly called functions, `varray` and `vformat` deserve some extra care.\r\n\r\nIn practice, instead of using `initializer_list`, I'd probably create the vector, `reserve` on it (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105928 is scheduled to be merged early in 4.6), and then `push_back` items from `p_args` sequentially. This should both simplify and optimize the code. (or, alternatively, `resize` and loop through the args, assigning to `ptrw()`. This should be even faster but might be more annoying to implement).","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118#pullrequestreview-2980263612","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108118","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118#pullrequestreview-2980263612"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108118"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-02T18:38:58Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2981030561,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6xruqh","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I just realized `args` necessitates a copy anyway, in the same vein that `initializer_list` does. Therefore, this shouldn't be a performance regression.\r\n\r\nThe whole `initializer_list` thing is still relevant, but since it has no satisfying solution yet, I'm OK just simplifying the code for now.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108118#pullrequestreview-2981030561","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/